#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:3
#: 62788952a2984ed0b18a0761544538e6
msgid "随机表面切片（Random Slab）"
msgstr "Random Surface Slabs (Random Slab)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:5
#: 2c1ba285987c491f8e90f4f78e88a7c7
msgid "`Group`: `Surface` | `Class`: `RandomSlabCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:7
#: eb7119af59184dc2b531aafbfd86449b
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:9
#: 1eae35d9e56e4744a0dd5c8d67e71821
msgid "从体相结构按 Miller 指数、层数和真空厚度范围批量切出 slab，覆盖不同表面取向和几何参数组合。"
msgstr ""
"Cut slabs from a bulk structure over ranges of Miller indices, layer counts,"
" and vacuum thicknesses, covering multiple surface orientations and "
"geometries."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:11
#: 814dc24eb82d4cfa9c1a0e613e95b654
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:13
#: cfeace4e47814b66b754c1ac5d6da8ac
msgid "场景：模型在表面吸附能上系统性偏离 DFT"
msgstr "Scenario: model adsorption energies are systematically biased relative to DFT"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:15
#: fd1ad3acbe364bf9bffd15719cca96fb
msgid ""
"你在体相 Pt 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，体相弹性和声子都很好。然后跑 Pt(111) 表面上的 CO 吸附能——模型预测的吸附能比 DFT 弱 "
"0.5 eV，误差远超可接受范围。"
msgstr ""
"You trained an NEP model on bulk Pt and obtained good elastic and phonon "
"properties. For CO adsorption on Pt(111), however, the predicted adsorption "
"is 0.5 eV weaker than DFT, well outside the acceptable error."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:17
#: e39642f2dbdf4154a3c22d9d54219491
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 训练集里全是体相 Pt 结构，模型从来没见过表面的低配位原子。Pt(111) "
"表面的台阶位、平台位的局域环境与体相完全不同——配位数从 12 降到 9 甚至更低。模型需要见过多种表面取向和厚度的 slab 才能泛化到表面化学。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** The training set contains only bulk Pt, so the model has "
"never seen undercoordinated surface atoms. Terrace and step environments on "
"Pt(111) differ strongly from bulk coordination, dropping from 12 neighbors "
"to 9 or fewer. Include slabs with multiple orientations and thicknesses "
"before expecting transfer to surface chemistry."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:19
#: 24e8309d459a45b1a92d1e21780dfb86
msgid "**输入：** 一个体相 fcc Pt 单胞"
msgstr "**Input:** A bulk fcc Pt unit cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:21
#: 86799eff97cc4f7ab64628ecf94b2413
msgid "**目标：** 切出 (111) 面，3~6 层厚，10 Å 真空，覆盖多种 Miller 指数组合"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Generate slabs spanning several Miller-index combinations, with "
"3–6 layers and 10 Å of vacuum, including the (111) surface."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:23
#: 46fe0accf93145839f8ab7cf458f97b1
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:24
#: f2dc9ab58e514f8990a33ce26b38689e
msgid "`H Range` = `[0, 1, 1]`，`K Range` = `[0, 1, 1]`，`L Range` = `[1, 3, 1]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:25
#: 38615966a9444923b32d2724a7b652b4
msgid "`Layer Range` = `[3, 6, 1]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:26
#: b6afc1ac55414712892d2948740c4979
msgid "`Vacuum Range` = `[10, 10, 1]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:28
#: 08a5a89d15d540c0ad6ea63e0f992e1a
msgid ""
"**输出：** 多个 slab 结构，覆盖不同 hkl 组合、3~6 层厚度、10 Å 真空，带 "
"`Slab(hkl=...,L=...,vac=...)` 标签"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Slab structures over the selected *hkl* combinations and 3–6 "
"layer thicknesses with 10 Å vacuum, labeled `Slab(hkl=...,L=...,vac=...)`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:30
#: 3b76a0e4a4b4432dadf8d526bfcd4464
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:31
#: 94189928367146388643528891c15ac2
msgid "重训后计算 Pt(111) 上的 CO 吸附能，应该接近 DFT 参考"
msgstr ""
"After DFT labeling and retraining, recalculate CO adsorption on Pt(111) and "
"compare it with the DFT reference."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:32
#: b9197b38142a4a1f97a1ae3e28785f2f
msgid "检查 slab 上下表面没有重叠，真空层足够隔离周期镜像"
msgstr ""
"Check that the two slab surfaces do not overlap and that the vacuum "
"separates periodic images adequately."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:33
#: b666cf522f5146b0ae9126edd76b6d5f
msgid "如果表面能预测仍不准，扩大 `l_range` 到 `[1, 5, 1]` 覆盖更多高指数面"
msgstr ""
"If surface-energy predictions remain inaccurate, expand `l_range` to `[1, 5,"
" 1]` to include more orientations, while controlling the total count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:34
#: f8d55c94a63c4adfbc8db77fa2339b63
msgid "如果 slab 太薄表面效应过强，增大 `layer_range` 的下限"
msgstr ""
"If the slabs are too thin and the two surfaces interact strongly, raise the "
"lower bound of `layer_range`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:36
#: 0b454bbb30f043b8af178a6d78d57ddf
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:38
#: f950ddcb65d84c2493cad4f71719e7b6
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:39
#: 0a002809e9a24652bc1a418cda089c22
msgid "模型在表面相关任务（吸附、表面能、表面反应）上预测差"
msgstr ""
"The model is inaccurate for adsorption, surface energies, or surface "
"reactions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:40
#: 0f4c175f807c4db298bb7aef1083dad4
msgid "需要覆盖多种表面取向和厚度"
msgstr "You need to cover several surface orientations and thicknesses."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:41
#: 15af14caa05846f19e442b51d97f45ad
msgid "作为后续吸附/缺陷卡片的母结构"
msgstr "You need parent slabs for downstream adsorption or defect cards."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:43
#: a1ccd8fb06134b88a2d457a4b585584d
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:44
#: 58bf957a9cc44739901b53c6bc9d9213
msgid "只做体相性质训练，不需要表面结构"
msgstr "The model targets bulk properties only and does not need surface structures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:45
#: 12940cdfd4fc41928cbbeca24ee67940
msgid "已经手动切好了 slab，只需要做表面修饰"
msgstr ""
"The required slabs have already been prepared and only surface modification "
"is needed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:47
#: 623caf3c282948d1bdf376c412f15116
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:49
#: 78ea7b40c73548afbd19c1ec6a8b8434
msgid "H Range（h_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:51
#: 691a3ac1a6514a8280cf3f3c65e3761a
msgid "`Sequence[int]`，默认 (0, 1, 1)。`[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`，整数，定义切片的 Miller h 指数搜索空间。"
msgstr ""
"`Sequence[int]`, default: `(0, 1, 1)`. Integer `[minimum, maximum, step]` "
"range for the Miller *h* index."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:53
#: 27914697b49f4ee8b46b4a403a153253
msgid ""
"hkl 为 (0,0,0) 的组合自动跳过。填参数之前先心算一下：输出总数 = (h 点数) x (k 点数) x (l 点数) x (层数) x "
"(真空数)——别让五重循环悄悄把输出量炸了。"
msgstr ""
"The `(0, 0, 0)` combination is skipped. Before running, estimate the output "
"count as `Nh × Nk × Nl × Nlayers × Nvacuum`; the five nested ranges can grow"
" quickly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:55
#: 529269cfa3c740e4afd9e27e69401734
msgid "K Range（k_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:57
#: 67daa62e44a94c698170e904ee350c0d
msgid "`Sequence[int]`，默认 (0, 1, 1)。`[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`，和上面 h 一样用法。"
msgstr ""
"`Sequence[int]`, default: `(0, 1, 1)`. Integer `[minimum, maximum, step]` "
"range for the Miller *k* index."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:59
#: fb26787a2a7d4001b3ac88ccf2a415f0
msgid "h/k 设 [0,1,1] 只出低指数面，[0,2,1] 覆盖中等取向，[0,3,1] 进入探索区——组合数增长很快，注意控制范围。"
msgstr ""
"Using `[0,1,1]` for *h* and *k* limits the scan to low-index values; "
"`[0,2,1]` broadens it, while `[0,3,1]` is exploratory. Control both ranges "
"because their combinations multiply."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:61
#: ed969600e7e947b99ac4c4231089c6ed
msgid "L Range（l_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:63
#: 1060290d57fd455b8b1f46db4ab53f33
msgid ""
"`Sequence[int]`，默认 (1, 3, 1)。`[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`。注意 l 的默认起点不是 0，因为 (0,0,0) "
"没意义会直接跳过。"
msgstr ""
"`Sequence[int]`, default: `(1, 3, 1)`. Integer `[minimum, maximum, step]` "
"range for the Miller *l* index. Its default starts at 1 because `(0, 0, 0)` "
"is undefined and would be skipped."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:65
#: b3d9bfe925604536a6e985a30136d304
msgid "保守用 [1,1,1] 只切一个面；平衡用 [1,3,1] 覆盖 3 个不同 l 的面；探索用 [1,5,1] 但要准备好让输出数被五重循环放大。"
msgstr ""
"Use `[1,1,1]` for a single *l* value, `[1,3,1]` for routine coverage, and "
"`[1,5,1]` for exploration, accounting for multiplication by all other "
"ranges."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:67
#: 28450c259851484296bac2dda9b2c8ab
msgid "Layer Range（layer_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:69
#: c8f38548013c41208ced9b62309f5a3e
msgid "`Sequence[int]`，默认 (3, 6, 1)。`[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`，整数，控制每个 slab 的厚度（层数）。"
msgstr ""
"`Sequence[int]`, default: `(3, 6, 1)`. Integer `[minimum, maximum, step]` "
"range for slab thickness in atomic layers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:71
#: dc0325b608864ee8994f8d80a0d6c03e
msgid ""
"3~6 层是标准 slab 厚度——上下表面的原子环境已经近似体相了，表面能收敛不会因为厚度不够而飘。1~2 层的超薄 slab "
"量子尺寸效应明显，除非你有明确的物理原因，否则谨慎使用。8 层以上的厚 slab 对 DFT 预算不友好。"
msgstr ""
"Three to six layers is a practical starting range, but convergence must be "
"checked for the material and property of interest. One- or two-layer slabs "
"can show strong finite-size effects; slabs above eight layers increase DFT "
"cost substantially."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:73
#: 97115592ba374cd68c3f6a515cf90646
msgid "Vacuum Range（vacuum_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:75
#: f1a2c58568bf40f9b7c9f7ac1d119cd5
msgid "`Sequence[int]`，默认 (10, 10, 1)。`[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`，单位 Å。"
msgstr ""
"`Sequence[int]`, default: `(10, 10, 1)`. Vacuum-thickness range in Å, "
"expressed as `[minimum, maximum, step]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:77
#: 2c47806b3daa4974a57a3eeeb3387fca
msgid ""
"10 Å 对大多数场景是可靠的下限，足够隔断周期镜像之间的相互作用。如果你后续要在表面放吸附分子，拉高到 15-20 Å 确保吸附物不碰到镜像 "
"slab。低于 5 Å 不建议用——镜像 slab 的电子密度会穿透真空层。"
msgstr ""
"Ten Å is a common starting point, but vacuum convergence remains system "
"dependent. For adsorbates, 15–20 Å may be needed to avoid contact with the "
"periodic image. Vacuum below 5 Å is generally unsafe for isolated-slab "
"calculations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:79
#: b27f3e905c7a40f8946544f143161753
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:81
#: 73eb6d39cebf4c99bfdd154d891d6e81
msgid "低指数面（111，3~6 层，10 Å，少量输出）"
msgstr "Low-index surfaces ((111), 3–6 layers, 10 Å vacuum, few outputs)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:82
#: 041ca51ec0784783836b517c8ac6034f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomSlabCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"h_range\": [0, 1, 1],\n"
"  \"k_range\": [0, 1, 1],\n"
"  \"l_range\": [1, 1, 1],\n"
"  \"layer_range\": [3, 6, 1],\n"
"  \"vacuum_range\": [10, 10, 1]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:94
#: 1088bd07e15e4d328b08cd239b745c8c
msgid "多取向覆盖（h/k 0-1, l 1-3，3~6 层，10-15 Å）"
msgstr "Multiple orientations (*h/k*: 0–1, *l*: 1–3; 3–6 layers; 10–15 Å vacuum)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:95
#: 3b4f43d1b4984076bc44d997e70bc86c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomSlabCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"h_range\": [0, 1, 1],\n"
"  \"k_range\": [0, 1, 1],\n"
"  \"l_range\": [1, 3, 1],\n"
"  \"layer_range\": [3, 6, 1],\n"
"  \"vacuum_range\": [10, 15, 5]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:107
#: 65659823676f4cf1b38c0cd8ebb94a51
msgid "全取向探索（h/k 0-2, l 1-5，3~9 层，10-20 Å）"
msgstr ""
"Broad orientation exploration (*h/k*: 0–2, *l*: 1–5; 3–9 layers; 10–20 Å "
"vacuum)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:108
#: b6d3728e6ac34491800bfe11b654bc49
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomSlabCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"h_range\": [0, 2, 1],\n"
"  \"k_range\": [0, 2, 1],\n"
"  \"l_range\": [1, 5, 1],\n"
"  \"layer_range\": [3, 9, 3],\n"
"  \"vacuum_range\": [10, 20, 5]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:120
#: 804571198e5542db89819a1bb1ef9921
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:122
#: 77095dee7e884093bd0aa3fff8d87980
msgid "`Random Slab` → `Insert Defect`：先切表面，再加吸附原子"
msgstr "`Random Slab` → `Insert Defect`: cut surfaces, then place adsorbates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:123
#: 23cef2179c314317b83894bcced8d3d9
msgid "`Random Slab` → `Random Vacancy`：先切表面，再删表面原子构造空位"
msgstr ""
"`Random Slab` → `Random Vacancy`: cut surfaces, then remove surface atoms to"
" create vacancies."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:124
#: 437dbf08dd4a4ff8aa6a0690b8f2062b
msgid "`Super Cell` → `Random Slab`：先扩胞到足够大面内尺寸，再切片"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell` → `Random Slab`: enlarge the in-plane dimensions before cutting"
" slabs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:126
#: b735547316184b06a4b492d18a976cfb
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:128
#: 39f56b1f62c8431d9bf4134c2850daa6
msgid "**输出为空。** 通常因为 (0,0,0) 被跳过后没有有效 hkl 组合，或者体相的 Miller 指数组合和晶格不兼容。"
msgstr ""
"**No structures are produced.** After `(0, 0, 0)` is removed, the selected "
"ranges may contain no valid Miller combination, or the bulk lattice may be "
"incompatible with the requested cut."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:130
#: b80e58c81dad4babb7ecfa89248c9a82
msgid ""
"**输出数量爆炸。** h_range、k_range、l_range、layer_range、vacuum_range 五重循环。先估算：Nh x "
"Nk x Nl x Nlayer x Nvacuum。如果数字太大，先收窄 l_range 和 layer_range。"
msgstr ""
"**The output count is unexpectedly large.** The five ranges form a Cartesian"
" product. Estimate `Nh × Nk × Nl × Nlayer × Nvacuum`; if it is too large, "
"narrow `l_range` and `layer_range` first."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:132
#: 8261e023935a45e3be48262fc124dc1f
msgid "**Slab 上下表面重叠。** layer_range 下限太小时，slab 厚度可能小于 2 层原子间距。增大下限。"
msgstr ""
"**The upper and lower slab surfaces overlap or interact too strongly.** The "
"lower bound of `layer_range` is too small. Increase it and recheck thickness"
" convergence."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:134
#: a3fa337713b348b0b5a5dc43c6873795
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:136
#: 87d5ffe670e54f569fd3bef0a74ab157
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`Slab(hkl={h}{k}{l},L={层数},vac={真空})`"
msgstr "`Slab(hkl={h}{k}{l},L={layer count},vac={vacuum})`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:138
#: 7e0fe8829be34afbbb4ee7d89faadb4e
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:140
#: 4a1f8d63c75a4c0bac727ce61bf594f0
msgid "无随机性。同参数同输入 → 严格一致输出。"
msgstr "Deterministic: identical inputs and parameters produce identical outputs."
